  "note": "Weapon-attachment mass capture (suppressors by calibre, bipods, magnified and unmagnified optics). The family keyword is the literal token a vanilla classname carries (muzzle_snds_h, bipod_01, optic_aco), because the earlier product-name families (socom, sandman) never matched a vanilla classname. Every mass is from a manufacturer product page or datasheet, read directly or through the web archive when the maker site blocked a plain fetch. Tier 5 pages go to leads only. This file does not repeat the optic, laser, light and mount families already held in device_mass.json (atacr, razor, peq15, mawl, x300).",
